#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: gestor-listo-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "Gestor Listo for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Gestor Listo for WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: gestor-listo-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "Hand your gestor the quarter's sales in one click: invoice book, VAT summary and a ZIP with every invoice."
msgstr "Entrega a tu gestor las ventas del trimestre en un clic: libro de facturas, resumen de IVA y un ZIP con todas las facturas."

#. Author of the plugin
#: gestor-listo-for-woocommerce.php
msgid "Facilo"
msgstr "Facilo"

